ething important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le07ob11re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le07ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le07ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "Wouldn't you like to come home to a clean home every day? It's refreshing and relaxing especially after a hard day's work. Here are some ways you can maintain a clean house.\n<br/>\nYou shouldn't try to do all the chores yourself, especially if you live with other people, should you? I recommend dividing the chores equally. Have your spouse or housemates clean up after themselves. Remind them when they were supposed to do it, and forgot. You're weren't going to do it for them, were you? They'll think you were supposed to do it. You do not want the housework to become overwhelming again do you?", "id": 1}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob11re2img02.jpg", "text": "Schedule a major cleaning day into your calendar when everyone is supposed help out and do it properly. Have someone remind everyone. Isn't that how things get done?\n<br/>If you were going to make this day easier, you could make it entertaining. What was going to be a terrible day will in fact not be. Get everyone to choose their favorite music to play, and order pizza for lunch. Isn't it better to make things fun rather than tedious?", "id": 2}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob11re2img03.jpg", "text": "Have everyone decide together what to clean. That will prevent anything from being missed. If something needs a professional, then no one is supposed to touch it. Isn't it better to bring an expert in to make things better?<br/>\nAh, cleaning day. Let's make the day you were going to hate a fun day. Maybe after this you won't have to get everyone to do it again.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "text": "Wouldn't you like to come home to a clean house every day? It's refreshing and relaxing especially after a hard day's work. Here are some ways you can maintain a clean house.\nYou shouldn't try to do all the chores yourself. I recommend dividing the chores equally. Have your spouse or housemates clean up after themselves. Remind them when they were supposed to do it, and forgot. You're weren't going to do it for them, were you? They'll think you were supposed to do it. You do not want the housework to become overwhelming again do you?", "id": 1}, {"time": "31200", "image": "", "text": "Schedule a major cleaning day into your calendar when everyone is supposed help out and do it properly. Have someone remind everyone. Isn't that how things get done?\nIf you were going to make this day easier, you could make it entertaining. What was going to be a terrible day will in fact not be. Get everyone to choose their favorite music to play, and order pizza for lunch. Isn't it better to make things fun rather than tedious?", "id": 2}, {"time": "57100", "image": "", "text": "Have everyone decide together what to clean. That will prevent anything from being missed. If something needs a professional, then no one is supposed to touch it. Isn't it better to bring an expert in to make things better?\nAh, cleaning day. Let's make the day you were going to hate a fun day. Maybe after this you won't have to get everyone to do it again.", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le07ob11re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}